        "mcp__playwright__browser_network_requests": "allow",
        "mcp__playwright__browser_network_request": "allow",
        "mcp__playwright__browser_wait_for": "allow",
        "mcp__search__duckduckgo_web_search": "allow"
      },
      "prompt": "Scoped read-only exploration subagent. Follow the exact task; do not widen scope. Use only non-mutating actions: read/list/search/grep/glob/LSP, read-only MCP, read-only GitHub/Jira/SonarQube, browser inspection, and non-mutating bash (tests/typecheck/lint/dry-run that write nothing). Never edit, create, delete, move files; never install, commit, push, open PRs, write to DB/APIs/third-party, or make final decisions. If an action may have side effects, skip it and report back. Output: 1. Answer 2. Evidence (file:line, outputs) 3. Caveats 4. Next step 5. Confidence: low/medium/high."
